.TH "INSPEKT\-AUTOSTART" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-autostart \- Manage automatic startup at login (macOS).
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]autostart\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage automatic startup at login (macOS).
.PP
Uses a macOS LaunchAgent to start the bridge and API servers
automatically when you log in, so you don\(cqt have to run
\f[CR]inspekt start\f[R] manually.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\f[B]disable\f[R]
Remove the LaunchAgent and wrapper script.
.TP
\f[B]enable\f[R]
Install and activate the LaunchAgent.
.TP
\f[B]status\f[R]
Show the current autostart status.
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt autostart enable
inspekt autostart disable
inspekt autostart status
.EE
